[00:00.00] 作词 : Tarit Chiarakul
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Tarit Chiarakul
[00:08.49]Since you've stepped into my life
[00:13.34]Like someone brought the vision to the blind
[00:18.25]Every time that you smile
[00:22.95]Like the sun that shines in the midnight sky
[00:28.28]You are the only one
[00:33.30]You are the only one
[00:37.54]When you stand by my side
[00:42.27]I want to hold you tight and stop the time
[00:47.68]Anything that makes you cry
[00:51.99]I'm going to find the way to make your tears run dry
[00:57.35]You are the only one
[01:02.53]You are the only one
[01:06.46]You are the only one who can rewrite my story
[01:12.94]The only one who can rearrange my heart beat
[01:22.62]is you~
[01:25.94]You are the only one who can remake the world I've seen
[01:32.52]The only one who can replace my empty dream
[01:42.01]is you~
[01:47.35]If one day we have to say goodbye
[01:58.15]My love will belong to you until the day I die
[02:04.82]You are the only one who can rewrite my story
[02:11.35]The only one who can rearrange my heart beat
[02:20.55]is you~
